<title>USA: Rada Electronic names Grinberg chairman.</title>
<headline>Rada Electronic names Grinberg chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rada Electronic Industries Ltd said on Thursday it named Yair Grinberg as chairman, replacing Haim Nissenson, who remains president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Rada said promoting Grinberg from vice chairman to chairman will allow Nissenson more time to devote to developing the company's commercial aviation activities worldwide.</p>
<p>Rada is based in Israel. It makes electronic equipment for the aerospace and commercial aviation markets.</p>
</text>
